      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、この魔列車では\r\nお人好しは少しだけ封印しないと\r\n痛い目を見るかもよ。",
        "official_en": "But I’d stow that goody-two-shoes attitude if you want to survive this train.",
        "real_en": "But on this phantom train, you might get hurt if you don’t put that kindness aside for a bit."
