        "official_en_sha256": "45022962218652977efd686999fc190209446bffe47eb5102092d13993720d3e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "一個だけ先に伝えておくと、\r\n魔列車には「走っている理由」が\r\nあるはずなの。",
        "official_en": "Oh yeah, one thing before we start: There has to be a reason why this phantom train’s running.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
