        "official_en_sha256": "716d39b9421662f16727d8376e00dee0ba4173ff6327ed6524b645007d96f19a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "仕事上、魔物には詳しくてね。\r\nまだ推測の域を出ないけど\r\n知っている魔物かもしれない。",
        "official_en": "On account of my work, I know a thing or two about monsters, and my guess is that this is one of them.",
        "real_en": "My work has taught me a lot about monsters. It’s still just a guess, but this might be one I know."
      },
