      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺はレイン、グランシェルトの騎士だ。\r\n君はこの魔列車について、なにか知っているのか？",
        "official_en": "I’m Rain, a knight of Grandshelt. So have you found out anything about this train from your investigation?",
        "real_en": "I’m Rain, a knight of Grandshelt. Do you know anything about this phantom train?"
